      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A unique occurrence of antenatal thrombosis of the left main coronary artery in a term infant is presented. The clinical features are indistinguishable from those of several other forms of congenital heart disease. The etiology of the thrombosis is unknown."},
